    "detailed_description": "Step into the electrifying world of <strong>Maze Maverick</strong>. Think you've mastered mazes? Think again! Navigate unpredictable labyrinths, dodge crafty ghosts, and snatch up coins in this thrilling arcade extravaganza.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes Galore!</h2><br>- <strong>Arcade Mode</strong>: Classic mazing with a Maverick twist! Grab strawberries to sneak through walls or chomp on cherries to teach those ghosts a lesson. But beware, some ghosts aren't just wandering \u2013 they're hunting!<br>  <br>- <strong>Ghost Mode</strong>: Who needs walls? Roam freely, gather coins, but remember: these ghosts have had their morning coffee. They're twice as fast and twice as sneaky!<br>  <br>- <strong>Darken Mode:</strong> No peeking! Navigate with no minimap and no sneaky shortcuts. Just you, the coins, and a couple of ghosts. Hope you've got a good memory!<br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629610/extras/419428ea0ece92bc3ed789682e45b557.poster.avif?t=1698141522\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629610/extras/419428ea0ece92bc3ed789682e45b557.webm?t=1698141522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629610/extras/419428ea0ece92bc3ed789682e45b557.mp4?t=1698141522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>- <strong>Skybox Mode:</strong> Show off your maze prowess on open terrains! But don't get too cocky, one misstep and you're history.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features &amp; Fun Stuff:</h2><br>- \ud83c\udfae <strong>Dynamic Mazes</strong>: No repeats, no deja-vus. Every level offers a fresh, new challenge.<br>  <br>- \ud83d\udc7b <strong>Crafty Ghosts</strong>: Directly trying to catch you, each ghost adds its own pinch of chaos to the mix.<br>  <br>- \ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Stunning Controls &amp; Design</strong>: Smooth, responsive, and just downright fun.<br>  <br>- \ud83c\udf52 <strong>Power-ups &amp; More</strong>: Strawberries, cherries, and...wait, did that ghost just speed up?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629610/extras/ee22235a323ec3f19a65661a504ce89f.poster.avif?t=1698141522\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629610/extras/ee22235a323ec3f19a65661a504ce89f.webm?t=1698141522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629610/extras/ee22235a323ec3f19a65661a504ce89f.mp4?t=1698141522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Jump in, dodge, collect, and conquer! Are you maverick enough for <strong>Maze Maverick</strong>?",
